sequenceDiagram
    participant BR as Event Broker
    participant RT as Rating Service
    participant DB as Ratings DB
    participant LB as Leaderboard Cache
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant UI as Player UI

    BR->>RT: match.finished(event)
    RT->>RT: Select strategy (Elo/Glicko)
    RT->>DB: Update player ratings
    RT->>LB: Update leaderboard
    RT->>BR: rating.updated

    UI->>GW: GET /leaderboard
    GW->>LB: Fetch leaderboard
    LB-->>GW: top N
    GW-->>UI: leaderboard data


